// "Anneau Guimauve": a ring of marshmallow in a pastry land (issue #36), redrawn after the guide «
// Conception des circuits » (issue #148, docs/GAME_DESIGN.md § 16). Original layout, about 1537 m a
// lap, turning right, on a ring of sugar 10 to 17 m above the pink fields: the start straight; two
// hairpins (right, left) and the climb of the cake, a hairpin to the right at its top, a tight
// corner to the left; along the top, the risky jump's corner (a tight corner to the right, its
// inside a drop, that a ramp crosses); off the landing, a drop of 4 m; the lacets down the cake (a
// hairpin to the left, a hairpin to the right), the climb back and a tight corner to the right; the
// approach of the bulge and its bump; the bulge (its hidden road straight behind a stack of crates,
// while the road goes round); the last corner (its grass bridge behind a panel that breaks with a
// boost) and a bump before the grid. Six big turns (five hairpins and the bulge's S), four tight
// corners of 90°: no long soft curve, one long straight. The pieces of the shortcuts (the jump's
// corner and its landing; the bulge, the last corner and their paths) are the Coteau Citrouille's
// (the Corniche Cannelle's, issues #107, #156, #111), with other covers; the rest is new.
//
// Drawn as a plan of straights and arcs (hairpins of 22 m, tight corners of 18 m), its points every
// 8 m along it (the parameters below follow them).
//
// Format: see src/track/data.rs. Point 0 is the start line; karts drive toward point 1 (north, -Z),
// then turn right. The grid sits on the straight behind point 0.
(
    name: "Anneau Guimauve",
    // Dressing (issue #11): a pastry land (`assets/data/biomes.ron`), the same every time (seed),
    // and pieces placed by hand: gingerbread men at the start line (beyond the posts of its arch),
    // a giant birthday cake in the infield, giant donuts beside the start straight and the climb back.
    biome: "Guimauve",
    // Issue #104: its music (`assets/data/music.ron`).
    music: "sky-blue-street",
    decor_seed: 5,
    props: [
